  "description": "Testing helpers for OrionGuard. Provides DomainEventCapture and InMemoryDomainEventDispatcher for domain events, plus OrionGuardSnapshot (pin a validator's rules to a .verified.txt file) and OrionGuardCoverage (fail when a model property carries no rule), with framework-agnostic assertions (no xUnit / NUnit / FluentAssertions / Verify dependency). Works with any test runner.",
